@startuml sequence-view-my-reservations
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Sequence — View my reservations (UC6)

actor Customer
participant "Frontend\n(React SPA)" as FE
participant "REST API\n(FastAPI)" as API
database "Database\n(SQLite)" as DB

Customer -> FE: Open "My reservations"
FE -> API: GET /reservations/me (JWT)
API -> API: Identify the user from the JWT
API -> DB: SELECT reservations\nWHERE user_id = logged-in user\n(newest first)
DB --> API: reservations (with car)
API --> FE: 200 OK [reservations]
FE --> Customer: See list — car thumbnail,\ndates, price, payment method, status
@enduml
